{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人黃敏碩看好餐飲股小菜園(0999)，指公司採取新營運策略減價吸客，又引入機械人等人工智能技術提升效率。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2323.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Mp1L1rh2zP1790666210.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">他認為在現價8.88元已可買入，目標上望9.5元，7.9元止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Qf9UlYWI8L1790666240.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">小菜園(0999)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人投資策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　$8.8</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$9.5</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$7.9</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人伍禮賢推介瑞聲科技(2018)，看好業績持續改善，AI算力液冷業務亦有新進展，對前景亦是催化劑之一。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026nHl3yPXtFs1790666271.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股價曾見一個月低位後回升，他建議可待股價回落至39.5元博反彈，目標價42元，止蝕定在35元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ysGHtXWZz51790666293.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">瑞聲科技(2018)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人投資策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　現價</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$42</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$35</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T07:58:54.811348+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}